.* QUIWRKOOWN: WRKOBJOWN, the objects a user profile owns, with their
.* options; F11 swaps the attribute and ASP device for the text.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OBJCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LIBCL BASETYPE='CHAR 12'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=AUTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=USRPRF CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OOVIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=OBJCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=LIBCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJATR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJAUT CLASS=AUTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJATR ASPDEV OBJTEXT OBJAUT'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&OOVIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&OOVIEW. EQ "2"'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=Display descriptions
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=Display attributes
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='RETURN 22'.F22=Display entire name
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOBJOWN KEYL=KEYS HELP=WRKOOWNH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Objects by Owner
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATACOL WIDTH=28.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=USRPRF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/USRPRF'.User profile
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS ACTLEN=1 MAXHEAD=2 VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD EDTOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.2=Edit authority
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJAUT OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.5=Display authority
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?RNMOBJ OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.7=Rename
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD DSPOBJD OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.) DETAIL(*FULL)' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.8=Display description
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD ?CHGOBJOWN OBJ(&OBJLIB./&OBJ.) OBJTYPE(&OBJTYPE.)' HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.9=Change owner
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKOBJOWN/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJATR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJATR'.Attribute
.* The blanks wrap the heading over two rows, as the system shows it.
:LISTCOL VAR=ASPDEV USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ASPDEV'.ASP        Device
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJTEXT'.Text
:LISTCOL VAR=OBJAUT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OBJAUT'.Authority
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJATR ASPDEV'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJTEXT'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOOWNH.Work with Objects by Owner - Help
:P.Every object the user profile owns, with its attribute and ASP
device, or its text after F11. Type an option next to an object and
press Enter.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F5 reads the
objects again, F11 shows the other view.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USRPRF'.User profile
:P.The user profile shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKOBJOWN/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJATR'.Attribute
:P.The attribute of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/ASPDEV'.ASP        Device
:P.The ASP Device of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJAUT'.Authority
:P.The authority the public (users with no private authority and no
group authority) gets to the new object.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKOBJOWN/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Edit authority
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to edit authority it. The
Edit Object Authority (EDTOBJAUT) command runs for the entry.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it.
:PT.5=Display authority
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display authority it. The
Display Object Authority (DSPOBJAUT) command runs for the entry.
:PT.7=Rename
:PD.Type 7 next to an entry and press Enter to rename it. The Rename
Object (RNMOBJ) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.8=Display description
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to display description it.
The Display Object Description (DSPOBJD) command runs for the entry.
:PT.9=Change owner
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to change owner it. The
Change Object Owner (CHGOBJOWN) command is prompted for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
